いません（変化イベントを蓄積し、効果を検証してから判断します）。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"85.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"11.5\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,76.3 9.1,72.4 14.2,78.3 19.3,76.0 24.5,66.3 29.6,87.8 34.7,73.6 39.8,69.8 44.9,61.3 50.0,49.6 55.1,50.1 60.3,46.2 65.4,49.3 70.5,45.5 75.6,37.0 80.7,50.8 85.8,54.2 91.0,56.5 96.1,35.3 101.2,33.4 106.3,12.8 111.4,15.1 116.5,39.7 121.6,33.5 126.8,47.7 131.9,60.2 137.0,49.1 142.1,49.5 147.2,31.8 152.3,36.4 157.4,37.5 162.6,42.2 167.7,45.9 172.8,38.7 177.9,46.7 183.0,50.5 188.1,54.2 193.2,60.3 198.4,54.6 203.5,43.0 208.6,37.9 213.7,45.9 218.8,33.8 223.9,16.8 229.0,19.3 234.2,25.5 239.3,23.5 244.4,24.8 249.5,24.3 254.6,15.1 259.7,20.7 264.9,17.8 270.0,14.1 275.1,19.3 280.2,26.5 285.3,23.5 290.4,24.2 295.5,29.1 300.7,38.0 305.8,46.5 310.9,51.1 316.0,54.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 88.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 88.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 88.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 14.2 90.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 29.6 99.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"54.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><d